==Strategy==
===='''Chapter 1'''====
Short-ranged units who can take many hits from I.M. Phace are the way to go. A good thing to know for Chapter 1, especially if you are hunting for [[Treasure]]s, is that [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can complete the level alone and quickly: if he is strong enough to knockback a Star Peng in one attack (you will need a few Treasures and/or Attack UP [[Cat Combo]]s), you can simply do literally nothing until the [[Cat Cannon]] is ready, then summon A. Bahamut; he will kill the Shibalien, then attack the Maawth, take a hit and kill him. If Bahamut gets frozen by Maawth, reset as it will be impossible to win. After that, you will need to use the Cannon after the Star Peng is knocked back; Bahamut should kill the Peng without taking a single hit from him. The remaining part is simple: he will just kill the last two enemies without any problems, even if he gets frozen by I.M. Phace.

===='''Chapter 2'''====
In Chapter 2, Skelling is still relatively straightforward with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragons]] and Awakened Bahamut Cat. However, never underestimate this stage, as the ">1200" restriction forces you to use a few heavy powerhouses, which can easily be shredded by the enemies due to the lack of meatshields if you are not careful.

===='''Chapter 3'''====
In Chapter 3, this stage can be very difficult, as there are 4 Star Pengs, each with over 300,000 HP even if you have all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] up to this point. Once they stack, their 20K DPS each can be a big problem. However, once you get even an Inferior Treasure from this stage, it becomes much more manageable as each Star Peng will only have about 175,000 HP and 11,500 DPS.

Any unit from the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Elemental Pixies]] set can help massively here, as can [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Deathdealer]], [[Blanka (Uber Rare Cat)|Blanka]] or [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Saw Cat]].

